WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Channels” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose the website channel
Open Settings & channels, then choose the website channel.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Prepare the chat widget
Follow the available chat widget settings and copy the embed code from the page.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Add the code and test
Add the widget code to your website, then open the site as a visitor, send a test message and check that it arrives.
